# Admin rules

## Design
- Admin stays **light UI** (slate/white). Do not apply storefront Cyber-Organic dark theme to admin.

## Auth & APIs
- Gate admin routes/APIs with `assertAdmin` / `requireAdminUser` as established in the codebase.
- Prefer Zod validation on request bodies; return clear JSON errors.

## Architecture
- Keep admin UI thin; put mutations/queries in `services/` (or existing service modules).
- Hooks only wrap fetch to `/api/admin/*` or server actions — no business rules in components.
- After content mutations that affect the storefront, use existing `revalidateTag` / `revalidatePath` patterns — do not invent a second cache system.

## Documents / B2B
- Thai retail quotations (`/admin/quotations`) and B2B pro-forma (`/admin/documents/b2b-quote`) are separate domains — do not merge schemas or convert paths casually.
